      "title": "🎵 French Irregular Verbs Video Playlists",
      "content": "Learn French irregular verbs through song! Access our curated playlist on [YouTube](https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLBxB2tte5wOU&si=W07PDCAehZlUbSGE), or watch on [RuTube](https://rutube.ru/plst/1882480) (for learners in regions without YouTube access, such as Russia)."
